* 212_indirect_array.sno — indirect reference combined with array subscript
* Rung 2. 1 assertion.

        a = ARRAY(3)
        a<2> = 'x'

*       $.a<2> = value of a[2] reached through indirect then subscript
        DIFFER($.a<2>, 'x')                   :f(e001)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 212/001: $.var<index> indirect array' :(END)
e001

        OUTPUT = 'PASS 212_indirect_array (1/1)'
END
